<?php

return [
    // Breadcrumbs & titles
    'Information disclosure' => 'Pengungkapan informasi',
    'Exploiting' => 'Eksploitasi',
    'Information disclosure vulnerabilities' => 'Kerentanan pengungkapan informasi',
    'How to find and exploit information disclosure vulnerabilities' => 'Cara menemukan dan mengeksploitasi kerentanan pengungkapan informasi',

    // Overview page
    "In this section, we'll explain the basics of information disclosure vulnerabilities and describe how you can find and exploit them. We'll also offer some guidance on how you can prevent information disclosure vulnerabilities in your own websites." => 'Pada bagian ini, kami menjelaskan dasar kerentanan pengungkapan informasi beserta cara menemukan, mengeksploitasi, dan mencegah celah tersebut pada situs web Anda.',
    'Learning to find and exploit information disclosure is a vital skill for any tester. You are likely to encounter it on a regular basis and, once you know how to exploit it effectively, it can help you to improve your testing efficiency and enable you to find additional, high-severity bugs.' => 'Kemampuan mendeteksi dan memanfaatkan pengungkapan informasi sangat penting bagi setiap penguji keamanan. Celah ini kerap muncul dan, jika dimanfaatkan dengan tepat, dapat mempercepat pengujian sekaligus membuka jalan menuju bug berdampak tinggi.',
    "If you're already familiar with the basic concepts behind information disclosure vulnerabilities and just want to practice exploiting them on some realistic, deliberately vulnerable targets, you can access all of the labs in this topic from the link below." => 'Jika Anda sudah memahami konsep dasar kerentanan pengungkapan informasi dan ingin langsung berlatih eksploitasi pada target simulasi yang rentan, akses seluruh lab pada topik ini melalui tautan berikut.',
    'View all information disclosure labs' => 'Lihat semua lab pengungkapan informasi',
    'What is information disclosure?' => 'Apa itu pengungkapan informasi?',
    'Information disclosure, also known as information leakage, is when a website unintentionally reveals sensitive information to its users. Depending on the context, websites may leak all kinds of information to a potential attacker, including:' => 'Pengungkapan informasi (information disclosure), atau kebocoran informasi, terjadi ketika situs web secara tidak sengaja membocorkan data sensitif kepada penggunanya. Bergantung pada konteksnya, situs dapat membocorkan berbagai hal kepada penyerang, antara lain:',
    'Data about other users, such as usernames or financial information' => 'Data pengguna lain, seperti username atau informasi keuangan',
    'Sensitive commercial or business data' => 'Data komersial atau bisnis yang bersifat rahasia',
    'Technical details about the website and its infrastructure' => 'Detail teknis mengenai situs web beserta infrastrukturnya',
    'The dangers of leaking sensitive user or business data are fairly obvious, but disclosing technical information can sometimes be just as serious. Although some of this information will be of limited use, it can potentially be a starting point for exposing an additional attack surface, which may contain other interesting vulnerabilities. The knowledge that you are able to gather could even provide the missing piece of the puzzle when trying to construct complex, high-severity attacks.' => 'Risiko kebocoran data pengguna atau bisnis tentu jelas, namun pengungkapan detail teknis bisa sama berbahayanya. Informasi teknis dapat memperluas permukaan serangan menuju celah lain, bahkan menjadi potongan petunjuk kunci saat menyusun eksploitasi kompleks berdampak tinggi.',
    "Occasionally, sensitive information might be carelessly leaked to users who are simply browsing the website in a normal fashion. More commonly, however, an attacker needs to elicit the information disclosure by interacting with the website in unexpected or malicious ways. They will then carefully study the website's responses to try and identify interesting behavior." => 'Terkadang informasi sensitif terbocor begitu saja saat pengguna menelusuri situs secara normal. Namun lebih sering, penyerang memancing kebocoran dengan mengirim masukan tak terduga lalu menelaah respons server untuk mengenali perilaku yang tidak semestinya.',
    'Examples of information disclosure' => 'Contoh pengungkapan informasi',
    'Some basic examples of information disclosure are as follows:' => 'Berikut beberapa contoh umum pengungkapan informasi:',
    'Revealing the names of hidden directories, their structure, and their contents via a [[C0]] file or directory listing' => 'Mengungkap nama direktori tersembunyi, struktur, serta isinya melalui berkas [[C0]] atau daftar direktori terbuka',
    'Providing access to source code files via temporary backups' => 'Memberikan akses ke berkas kode sumber melalui file cadangan sementara',
    'Explicitly mentioning database table or column names in error messages' => 'Menyebutkan nama tabel atau kolom basis data secara eksplisit pada pesan error',
    'Unnecessarily exposing highly sensitive information, such as credit card details' => 'Menampilkan data sangat sensitif secara tidak perlu, misalnya detail kartu kredit',
    'Hard-coding API keys, IP addresses, database credentials, and so on in the source code' => 'Menanamkan API key, alamat IP, atau kredensial basis data langsung di dalam kode sumber',
    'Hinting at the existence or absence of resources, usernames, and so on via subtle differences in application behavior' => 'Memberi petunjuk ada tidaknya resource atau username lewat perbedaan tipis pada perilaku aplikasi',
    'In this topic, you will learn how to find and exploit some of these examples and more.' => 'Pada topik ini, Anda akan mempelajari cara menemukan dan mengeksploitasi contoh-contoh tersebut beserta variasinya.',
    'How do information disclosure vulnerabilities arise?' => 'Bagaimana kerentanan pengungkapan informasi muncul?',
    'Information disclosure vulnerabilities can arise in countless different ways, but these can broadly be categorized as follows:' => 'Kerentanan pengungkapan informasi dapat terjadi melalui beragam cara, yang secara garis besar terbagi menjadi kategori berikut:',
    '<strong>Failure to remove internal content from public content</strong>. For example, developer comments in markup are sometimes visible to users in the production environment.' => '<strong>Kegagalan menghapus konten internal dari konten publik</strong>. Misalnya, komentar pengembang di dalam markup yang masih terlihat di lingkungan produksi.',
    '<strong>Insecure configuration of the website and related technologies</strong>. For example, failing to disable debugging and diagnostic features can sometimes provide attackers with useful tools to help them obtain sensitive information. Default configurations can also leave websites vulnerable, for example, by displaying overly verbose error messages.' => '<strong>Konfigurasi situs dan teknologi pendukung yang tidak aman</strong>. Misalnya, fitur debug atau diagnostik dibiarkan aktif maupun setelan bawaan tetap menampilkan pesan error yang terlalu rinci.',
    '<strong>Flawed design and behavior of the application</strong>. For example, if a website returns distinct responses when different error states occur, this can also allow attackers to [[A0]]enumerate sensitive data[[/A0]], such as valid user credentials.' => '<strong>Desain dan perilaku aplikasi yang cacat</strong>. Misalnya, aplikasi mengembalikan respons berbeda untuk kondisi error tertentu sehingga penyerang dapat [[A0]]mengenumerasi data sensitif[[/A0]], seperti kredensial pengguna yang valid.',
    'What is the impact of information disclosure vulnerabilities?' => 'Apa dampak kerentanan pengungkapan informasi?',
    "Information disclosure vulnerabilities can have both a direct and indirect impact depending on the purpose of the website and, therefore, what information an attacker is able to obtain. In some cases, the act of disclosing sensitive information alone can have a high impact on the affected parties. For example, an online shop leaking its customers' credit card details is likely to have severe consequences." => 'Pengungkapan informasi dapat berdampak langsung maupun tidak langsung bergantung pada fungsi situs serta jenis data yang terekspos. Kebocoran data sensitif seperti detail kartu kredit pelanggan pada toko daring sudah langsung menimbulkan kerugian serius.',
    'On the other hand, leaking technical information, such as the directory structure or which third-party frameworks are being used, may have little to no direct impact. However, in the wrong hands, this could be the key information required to construct any number of other exploits. The severity in this case depends on what the attacker is able to do with this information.' => 'Sebaliknya, kebocoran detail teknis seperti struktur direktori atau jenis framework pihak ketiga mungkin tidak berdampak langsung, tetapi bisa menjadi informasi kunci bagi penyerang untuk menyusun serangan lanjutan. Tingkat keparahannya bergantung pada hal lanjutan yang dapat dicapai dari data tersebut.',
    'How to assess the severity of information disclosure vulnerabilities' => 'Cara menilai tingkat keparahan kerentanan pengungkapan informasi',
    'Although the ultimate impact can potentially be very severe, it is only in specific circumstances that information disclosure is a high-severity issue on its own. During testing, the disclosure of technical information in particular is often only of interest if you are able to demonstrate how an attacker could do something harmful with it.' => 'Meski dampaknya bisa sangat serius, pengungkapan informasi jarang menjadi temuan berisiko tinggi secara berdiri sendiri kecuali datanya memang sensitif. Saat menguji detail teknis, temuan biasanya baru bermakna jika Anda mampu membuktikan skenario penyalahgunaannya.',
    'For example, the knowledge that a website is using a particular framework version is of limited use if that version is fully patched. However, this information becomes significant when the website is using an old version that contains a known vulnerability. In this case, performing a devastating attack could be as simple as applying a publicly documented exploit.' => 'Misalnya, mengetahui versi suatu framework tidak banyak berguna jika versi itu sudah sepenuhnya ditambal. Namun informasi tersebut menjadi sangat bernilai jika situs memakai versi lama dengan kerentanan publik yang mudah dieksploitasi.',
    'It is important to exercise common sense when you find that potentially sensitive information is being leaked. It is likely that minor technical details can be discovered in numerous ways on many of the websites you test. Therefore, your main focus should be on the impact and exploitability of the leaked information, not just the presence of information disclosure as a standalone issue. The obvious exception to this is when the leaked information is so sensitive that it warrants attention in its own right.' => 'Gunakan pertimbangan yang matang saat menemukan kebocoran informasi. Hampir semua situs membocorkan detail teknis kecil, jadi pusatkan perhatian pada dampak dan daya eksploitasi informasi tersebut, bukan sekadar keberadaannya, kecuali data yang bocor memang sangat sensitif.',
    'Exploiting information disclosure' => 'Mengeksploitasi pengungkapan informasi',
    "We've put together some more practical advice to help you identify and exploit these kinds of vulnerabilities. You can also practice these techniques using our interactive labs." => 'Kami telah merangkum panduan praktis untuk membantu Anda mengidentifikasi serta mengeksploitasi celah pengungkapan informasi lewat lab interaktif.',
    'How to prevent information disclosure vulnerabilities' => 'Cara mencegah kerentanan pengungkapan informasi',
    'Preventing information disclosure completely is tricky due to the huge variety of ways in which it can occur. However, there are some general best practices that you can follow to minimize the risk of these kinds of vulnerability creeping into your own websites.' => 'Mencegah kebocoran informasi sepenuhnya cukup menantang karena jalurnya sangat beragam. Meski begitu, beberapa praktik terbaik berikut membantu meminimalkan risikonya:',
    'Make sure that everyone involved in producing the website is fully aware of what information is considered sensitive. Sometimes seemingly harmless information can be much more useful to an attacker than people realize. Highlighting these dangers can help make sure that sensitive information is handled more securely in general by your organization.' => 'Pastikan seluruh tim memahami jenis informasi yang tergolong sensitif. Detail yang tampak sepele kerap bernilai tinggi bagi penyerang.',
    'Audit any code for potential information disclosure as part of your QA or build processes. It should be relatively easy to automate some of the associated tasks, such as stripping developer comments.' => 'Periksa kode sumber secara rutin pada proses QA atau build, termasuk mengotomatiskan penghapusan komentar pengembang.',
    "Use generic error messages as much as possible. Don't provide attackers with clues about application behavior unnecessarily." => 'Gunakan pesan error generik sebisa mungkin agar penyerang tidak memperoleh petunjuk cara kerja internal aplikasi.',
    'Double-check that any debugging or diagnostic features are disabled in the production environment.' => 'Pastikan seluruh fitur debug dan diagnostik dinonaktifkan sebelum masuk ke lingkungan produksi.',
    "Make sure you fully understand the configuration settings, and security implications, of any third-party technology that you implement. Take the time to investigate and disable any features and settings that you don't actually need." => 'Pahami setelan konfigurasi serta implikasi keamanan dari setiap teknologi pihak ketiga, lalu nonaktifkan fitur bawaan yang tidak diperlukan.',

    // Exploiting page
    "In this section, we'll provide practical advice on some techniques and tools that you can use to help identify information disclosure in a broad range of contexts. We've also provided several labs so that you can practice extracting different kinds of information that could be used as part of a further attack." => 'Bagian ini menyajikan panduan praktis mengenai teknik dan alat untuk mendeteksi pengungkapan informasi di berbagai skenario, dilengkapi lab interaktif guna melatih pengambilan data sensitif sebagai pijakan serangan lanjutan.',
    '[[A0]]Testing for information disclosure vulnerabilities[[/A0]]' => '[[A0]]Menguji kerentanan pengungkapan informasi[[/A0]]',
    '[[A0]]Common sources of information disclosure[[/A0]] [[S0]]LABS[[/S0]]' => '[[A0]]Sumber umum pengungkapan informasi[[/A0]] [[S0]]LAB PRAKTIK[[/S0]]',
    'How to test for information disclosure vulnerabilities' => 'Cara menguji kerentanan pengungkapan informasi',
    'Generally speaking, it is important not to develop "tunnel vision" during testing. In other words, you should avoid focussing too narrowly on a particular vulnerability. Sensitive data can be leaked in all kinds of places, so it is important not to miss anything that could be useful later. You will often find sensitive data while testing for something else. A key skill is being able to recognize interesting information whenever and wherever you do come across it.' => 'Saat menguji keamanan, hindari fokus yang terlalu sempit pada satu jenis celah saja. Data sensitif dapat bocor di mana saja dan sering kali ditemukan secara tidak sengaja ketika menguji fitur lain.',
    'The following are some examples of high-level techniques and tools that you can use to help identify information disclosure vulnerabilities during testing.' => 'Berikut beberapa teknik dan perangkat utama untuk membantu mengidentifikasi celah pengungkapan informasi selama pengujian.',
    '[[A0]]Fuzzing[[/A0]]' => '[[A0]]Fuzzing[[/A0]]',
    '[[A0]]Using Burp Scanner[[/A0]]' => '[[A0]]Menggunakan Burp Scanner[[/A0]]',
    "[[A0]]Using Burp's engagement tools[[/A0]]" => '[[A0]]Menggunakan fitur engagement Burp[[/A0]]',
    '[[A0]]Engineering informative responses[[/A0]]' => '[[A0]]Memancing respons informatif[[/A0]]',
    'Fuzzing' => 'Fuzzing',
    "If you identify interesting parameters, you can try submitting unexpected data types and specially crafted fuzz strings to see what effect this has. Pay close attention; although responses sometimes explicitly disclose interesting information, they can also hint at the application's behavior more subtly. For example, this could be a slight difference in the time taken to process the request. Even if the content of an error message doesn't disclose anything, sometimes the fact that one error case was encountered instead of another one is useful information in itself." => 'Jika Anda menemukan parameter menarik, coba kirimkan tipe data tak terduga maupun rangkaian string fuzzing. Amati dengan saksama: selain teks error eksplisit, perbedaan waktu pemrosesan atau kondisi error yang berbeda saja sudah dapat memberi informasi berharga.',
    'You can automate much of this process using tools such as Burp Intruder. This provides several benefits. Most notably, you can:' => 'Proses ini dapat diotomatisasi memakai alat seperti Burp Intruder yang memudahkan Anda untuk:',
    'Add payload positions to parameters and use pre-built wordlists of fuzz strings to test a high volume of different inputs in quick succession.' => 'Menandai posisi payload pada parameter dan menguji daftar string fuzz secara cepat dalam jumlah besar.',
    'Easily identify differences in responses by comparing HTTP status codes, response times, lengths, and so on.' => 'Membandingkan perbedaan respons lewat kode status HTTP, waktu respons, panjang isi, dan indikator lain.',
    'Use grep matching rules to quickly identify occurrences of keywords, such as [[C0]], [[C1]], [[C2]], [[C3]], and so on.' => 'Menerapkan aturan pencarian pola untuk mendeteksi kata kunci seperti [[C0]], [[C1]], [[C2]], [[C3]], dan sejenisnya.',
    'Apply grep extraction rules to extract and compare the content of interesting items within responses.' => 'Menerapkan ekstraksi pola guna mengambil dan membandingkan item menarik di dalam respons.',
    "You can also use the [[A0]]Logger++[[/A0]] extension, available from the BApp store. In addition to logging requests and responses from all of Burp's tools, it allows you to define advanced filters for highlighting interesting entries. This is just one of the many Burp extensions that can help you find any sensitive data that is leaked by the website." => 'Anda juga dapat memakai ekstensi [[A0]]Logger++[[/A0]] untuk mencatat seluruh permintaan dan respons serta menyaring entri yang mengandung kebocoran data.',
    'Using Burp Scanner' => 'Menggunakan Burp Scanner',
    'Burp Suite Professional users have the benefit of Burp Scanner. This provides live scanning features for auditing items while you browse, or you can schedule automated scans to crawl and audit the target site on your behalf. Both approaches will automatically flag many information disclosure vulnerabilities for you. For example, Burp Scanner will alert you if it finds sensitive information such as private keys, email addresses, and credit card numbers in a response. It will also identify any backup files, directory listings, and so on.' => 'Pengguna Burp Suite Professional dapat memanfaatkan Burp Scanner untuk pemindaian langsung maupun otomatis, yang secara bawaan menandai kebocoran seperti kunci privat, email, nomor kartu kredit, berkas cadangan, hingga daftar direktori.',
    "Using Burp's engagement tools" => 'Menggunakan fitur engagement Burp',
    'Burp provides several engagement tools that you can use to find interesting information in the target website more easily. You can access the engagement tools from the context menu - just right-click on any HTTP message, Burp Proxy entry, or item in the site map and go to "Engagement tools".' => 'Burp menyediakan sejumlah alat peninjauan melalui menu klik kanan "Engagement tools" pada pesan HTTP, riwayat proxy, atau peta situs.',
    'The following tools are particularly useful in this context.' => 'Fitur berikut sangat membantu dalam konteks pengungkapan informasi:',
    'Search' => 'Search',
    'You can use this tool to look for any expression within the selected item. You can fine-tune the results using various advanced search options, such as regex search or negative search. This is useful for quickly finding occurrences (or absences) of specific keywords of interest.' => 'Alat ini mencari ekspresi apa pun pada item terpilih dengan opsi regex maupun pencarian negatif untuk menemukan kata kunci tertentu.',
    'Find comments' => 'Find comments',
    'You can use this tool to quickly extract any developer comments found in the selected item. It also provides tabs to instantly access the HTTP request/response cycle in which each comment was found.' => 'Alat ini mengekstrak komentar pengembang secara cepat dari respons terpilih lengkap dengan akses langsung ke transaksi HTTP terkait.',
    'Discover content' => 'Discover content',
    "You can use this tool to identify additional content and functionality that is not linked from the website's visible content. This can be useful for finding additional directories and files that won't necessarily appear in the site map automatically." => 'Alat ini menemukan direktori dan berkas tersembunyi yang tidak tertaut secara langsung dari halaman publik situs.',
    'Engineering informative responses' => 'Memancing respons informatif',
    'Verbose error messages can sometimes disclose interesting information while you go about your normal testing workflow. However, by studying the way error messages change according to your input, you can take this one step further. In some cases, you will be able to manipulate the website in order to extract arbitrary data via an error message.' => 'Pesan error yang rinci tidak hanya membocorkan informasi secara pasif. Dengan mengamati perubahan pesan error berdasarkan masukan, penyerang terkadang dapat memanipulasi aplikasi untuk mengekstrak data langsung melalui error tersebut.',
    'There are numerous methods for doing this depending on the particular scenario you encounter. One common example is to make the application logic attempt an invalid action on a specific item of data. For example, submitting an invalid parameter value might lead to a stack trace or debug response that contains interesting details. You can sometimes cause error messages to disclose the value of your desired data in the response.' => 'Salah satu caranya adalah memaksa logika aplikasi melakukan operasi tidak valid terhadap suatu data, misalnya mengirim tipe nilai keliru sehingga muncul stack trace atau pesan debug yang mengungkap nilai sebenarnya.',
    'Common sources of information disclosure' => 'Sumber umum pengungkapan informasi',
    'Information disclosure can occur in a wide variety of contexts within a website. The following are some common examples of places where you can look to see if sensitive information is exposed.' => 'Kebocoran informasi dapat muncul di berbagai bagian situs web. Berikut sejumlah lokasi umum yang layak diperiksa.',
    '[[A0]]Files for web crawlers[[/A0]]' => '[[A0]]Berkas untuk perayap web[[/A0]]',
    '[[A0]]Directory listings[[/A0]]' => '[[A0]]Daftar direktori[[/A0]]',
    '[[A0]]Developer comments[[/A0]]' => '[[A0]]Komentar pengembang[[/A0]]',
    '[[A0]]Error messages[[/A0]] [[S0]]LABS[[/S0]]' => '[[A0]]Pesan error[[/A0]] [[S0]]LAB PRAKTIK[[/S0]]',
    '[[A0]]Debugging data[[/A0]] [[S0]]LABS[[/S0]]' => '[[A0]]Data debugging[[/A0]] [[S0]]LAB PRAKTIK[[/S0]]',
    '[[A0]]User account pages[[/A0]] [[S0]]LABS[[/S0]]' => '[[A0]]Halaman akun pengguna[[/A0]] [[S0]]LAB PRAKTIK[[/S0]]',
    '[[A0]]Backup files[[/A0]] [[S0]]LABS[[/S0]]' => '[[A0]]Berkas cadangan[[/A0]] [[S0]]LAB PRAKTIK[[/S0]]',
    '[[A0]]Insecure configuration[[/A0]] [[S0]]LABS[[/S0]]' => '[[A0]]Konfigurasi tidak aman[[/A0]] [[S0]]LAB PRAKTIK[[/S0]]',
    '[[A0]]Version control history[[/A0]] [[S0]]LABS[[/S0]]' => '[[A0]]Riwayat kontrol versi[[/A0]] [[S0]]LAB PRAKTIK[[/S0]]',
    'Files for web crawlers' => 'Berkas untuk perayap web',
    'Many websites provide files at [[C0]] and [[C1]] to help crawlers navigate their site. Among other things, these files often list specific directories that the crawlers should skip, for example, because they may contain sensitive information.' => 'Banyak situs menyediakan [[C0]] dan [[C1]] bagi mesin pencari. Berkas ini sering mencantumkan direktori yang dilarang dirayapi justru karena berisi halaman atau data sensitif.',
    "As these files are not usually linked from within the website, they may not immediately appear in Burp's site map. However, it is worth trying to navigate to [[C0]] or [[C1]] manually to see if you find anything of use." => 'Karena jarang ditautkan di halaman utama, berkas tersebut tidak selalu otomatis muncul di peta situs. Cobalah mengakses [[C0]] atau [[C1]] secara manual.',
    'Directory listings' => 'Daftar direktori',
    'Web servers can be configured to automatically list the contents of directories that do not have an index page present. This can aid an attacker by enabling them to quickly identify the resources at a given path, and proceed directly to analyzing and attacking those resources. It particularly increases the exposure of sensitive files within the directory that are not intended to be accessible to users, such as temporary files and crash dumps.' => 'Server web dapat dikonfigurasi untuk menampilkan isi direktori secara otomatis apabila berkas indeks tidak tersedia. Hal ini memudahkan penyerang menemukan file sementara atau crash dump yang seharusnya tersembunyi.',
    'Directory listings themselves are not necessarily a security vulnerability. However, if the website also fails to implement proper access control, leaking the existence and location of sensitive resources in this way is clearly an issue.' => 'Daftar direktori tidak selalu berbahaya jika hanya berisi berkas publik. Namun tanpa kontrol akses yang memadai, kebocoran lokasi berkas sensitif menjadi risiko keamanan yang nyata.',
    'Developer comments' => 'Komentar pengembang',
    "During development, in-line HTML comments are sometimes added to the markup. These comments are typically stripped before changes are deployed to the production environment. However, comments can sometimes be forgotten, missed, or even left in deliberately because someone wasn't fully aware of the security implications. Although these comments are not visible on the rendered page, they can easily be accessed using Burp, or even the browser's built-in developer tools." => 'Saat pengembangan, komentar HTML sering ditambahkan ke dalam markup lalu terlupa dihapus saat rilis produksi. Walau tidak terlihat pada tampilan halaman, komentar ini mudah dibaca lewat DevTools atau inspeksi HTTP.',
    'Occasionally, these comments contain information that is useful to an attacker. For example, they might hint at the existence of hidden directories or provide clues about the application logic.' => 'Komentar semacam ini kerap menyimpan petunjuk direktori tersembunyi, kredensial uji coba, atau cara kerja logika aplikasi.',
    'Error messages' => 'Pesan error',
    'One of the most common causes of information disclosure is verbose error messages. As a general rule, you should pay close attention to all error messages you encounter during auditing.' => 'Salah satu pemicu paling umum dari pengungkapan informasi adalah pesan error yang terlalu rinci. Perhatikan setiap pesan error yang muncul selama proses audit.',
    'The content of error messages can reveal information about what input or data type is expected from a given parameter. This can help you to narrow down your attack by identifying exploitable parameters. It may even just prevent you from wasting time trying to inject payloads that simply won\'t work.' => 'Isi pesan error dapat mengungkap format atau tipe data yang diharapkan suatu parameter, sehingga membantu mempersempit parameter yang rentan serta menyusun payload yang tepat.',
    'Verbose error messages can also provide information about different technologies being used by the website. For example, they might explicitly name a template engine, database type, or server that the website is using, along with its version number. This information can be useful because you can easily search for any documented exploits that may exist for this version. Similarly, you can check whether there are any common configuration errors or dangerous default settings that you may be able to exploit. Some of these may be highlighted in the official documentation.' => 'Pesan error juga sering menyebut jenis mesin template, basis data, atau server web beserta nomor versinya, sehingga penyerang dapat langsung mencari celah atau setelan bawaan berbahaya untuk versi tersebut.',
    'You might also discover that the website is using some kind of open-source framework. In this case, you can study the publicly available source code, which is an invaluable resource for constructing your own exploits.' => 'Jika situs diketahui memakai framework sumber terbuka, penyerang dapat menelaah kode sumber publiknya guna merancang eksploit yang akurat.',
    'Differences between error messages can also reveal different application behavior that is occurring behind the scenes. Observing differences in error messages is a crucial aspect of many techniques, such as SQL injection, [[A0]]username enumeration[[/A0]], and so on.' => 'Perbedaan antarpesan error turut mengungkap perbedaan alur logika di balik layar, teknik penting dalam SQL injection maupun [[A0]]enumerasi username[[/A0]].',
    'Debugging data' => 'Data debugging',
    "For debugging purposes, many websites generate custom error messages and logs that contain large amounts of information about the application's behavior. While this information is useful during development, it is also extremely useful to an attacker if it is leaked in the production environment." => 'Untuk kebutuhan debugging, aplikasi sering menghasilkan log dan laporan error terperinci. Data yang sangat membantu di tahap pengembangan ini justru berbahaya bila terekspos di lingkungan produksi.',
    'Debug messages can sometimes contain vital information for developing an attack, including:' => 'Pesan debug terkadang memuat detail krusial untuk menyerang aplikasi, seperti:',
    'Values for key session variables that can be manipulated via user input' => 'Nilai variabel sesi penting yang dapat dipengaruhi masukan pengguna',
    'Hostnames and credentials for back-end components' => 'Nama host dan kredensial komponen backend',
    'File and directory names on the server' => 'Nama berkas dan direktori di server',
    'Keys used to encrypt data transmitted via the client' => 'Kunci enkripsi data yang dikirim melalui klien',
    "Debugging information may sometimes be logged in a separate file. If an attacker is able to gain access to this file, it can serve as a useful reference for understanding the application's runtime state. It can also provide several clues as to how they can supply crafted input to manipulate the application state and control the information received." => 'Jika informasi debug dicatat pada berkas log terpisah dan berhasil diakses penyerang, mereka dapat memetakan kondisi runtime aplikasi serta menyusun masukan khusus untuk memanipulasinya.',
    'User account pages' => 'Halaman akun pengguna',
    "By their very nature, a user's profile or account page usually contains sensitive information, such as the user's email address, phone number, API key, and so on. As users normally only have access to their own account page, this does not represent a vulnerability in itself. However, some websites contain logic flaws that potentially allow an attacker to leverage these pages in order to view other users' data." => 'Halaman profil pengguna lazimnya memuat alamat email, nomor telepon, atau API key. Halaman ini aman selama hanya pemilik akun yang dapat membukanya, namun cacat logika bisa membukanya untuk pengguna lain.',
    "For example, consider a website that determines which user's account page to load based on a [[C0]] parameter." => 'Contohnya, situs menentukan halaman profil yang dimuat berdasarkan parameter [[C0]].',
    'Most websites will take steps to prevent an attacker from simply changing this parameter to access arbitrary users\' account pages. However, sometimes the logic for loading individual items of data is not as robust.' => 'Sebagian besar situs memang membatasi penggantian parameter ini agar halaman profil pengguna lain tidak terbuka. Namun, logika pemuatan komponen data tertentu sering kali luput dilindungi.',
    "An attacker may not be able to load another users' account page entirely, but the logic for fetching and rendering the user's registered email address, for example, might not check that the [[C0]] parameter matches the user that is currently logged in. In this case, simply changing the [[C0]] parameter would allow an attacker to display arbitrary users' email addresses on their own account page." => 'Penyerang mungkin tidak dapat membuka seluruh halaman profil orang lain, tetapi logika yang mengambil alamat email terdaftar bisa saja tidak memeriksa kecocokan parameter [[C0]] dengan akun yang sedang masuk, sehingga alamat email pengguna lain ikut tampil.',
    "We'll look at these kind of vulnerabilities in more detail when we cover access control and IDOR vulnerabilities." => 'Pola kerentanan ini dibahas lebih lanjut pada materi kontrol akses dan IDOR.',
    'Access control' => 'Kontrol akses',
    'Source code disclosure via backup files' => 'Pengungkapan kode sumber melalui berkas cadangan',
    "Obtaining source code access makes it much easier for an attacker to understand the application's behavior and construct high-severity attacks. Sensitive data is sometimes even hard-coded within the source code. Typical examples of this include API keys and credentials for accessing back-end components." => 'Mendapatkan kode sumber mempermudah penyerang memahami logika aplikasi serta mencari API key atau kredensial backend yang tertulis langsung di dalamnya.',
    'If you can identify that a particular open-source technology is being used, this provides easy access to a limited amount of source code.' => 'Mengenali teknologi sumber terbuka yang digunakan juga memberi akses langsung terhadap sebagian arsitektur kodenya.',
    'Occasionally, it is even possible to cause the website to expose its own source code. When mapping out a website, you might find that some source code files are referenced explicitly. Unfortunately, requesting them does not usually reveal the code itself. When a server handles files with a particular extension, such as [[C0]], it will typically execute the code, rather than simply sending it to the client as text. However, in some situations, you can trick a website into returning the contents of the file instead. For example, text editors often generate temporary backup files while the original file is being edited. These temporary files are usually indicated in some way, such as by appending a tilde ([[C1]]) to the filename or adding a different file extension. Requesting a code file using a backup file extension can sometimes allow you to read the contents of the file in the response.' => 'Meminta berkas berekstensi [[C0]] secara langsung biasanya memicu server mengeksekusinya alih-alih menampilkan teks kodenya. Namun jika editor teks meninggalkan file cadangan sementara (misalnya dengan akhiran tilde [[C1]] atau ekstensi lain), permintaan ke berkas cadangan tersebut dapat mengembalikan isi kode sumber sebagai teks polos.',
    'Once an attacker has access to the source code, this can be a huge step towards being able to identify and exploit additional vulnerabilities that would otherwise be almost impossible. One such example is insecure deserialization. We\'ll look at this vulnerability later in a dedicated topic.' => 'Setelah kode sumber terbaca, penyerang jauh lebih mudah menemukan celah lanjutan seperti insecure deserialization.',
    'Insecure deserialization' => 'Insecure deserialization',
    'Information disclosure due to insecure configuration' => 'Pengungkapan informasi akibat konfigurasi tidak aman',
    "Websites are sometimes vulnerable as a result of improper configuration. This is especially common due to the widespread use of third-party technologies, whose vast array of configuration options are not necessarily well-understood by those implementing them." => 'Kerentanan juga sering timbul karena kesalahan konfigurasi teknologi pihak ketiga yang opsi pengaturannya tidak dipahami secara menyeluruh.',
    'In other cases, developers might forget to disable various debugging options in the production environment. For example, the HTTP [[C0]] method is designed for diagnostic purposes. If enabled, the web server will respond to requests that use the [[C1]] method by echoing in the response the exact request that was received. This behavior is often harmless, but occasionally leads to information disclosure, such as the name of internal authentication headers that may be appended to requests by reverse proxies.' => 'Pengembang juga kerap lupa mematikan fitur diagnostik seperti metode HTTP [[C0]]. Jika aktif, server memantulkan kembali permintaan [[C1]] yang diterima lengkap beserta header autentikasi internal yang mungkin disisipkan reverse proxy.',
    'Version control history' => 'Riwayat kontrol versi',
    'Virtually all websites are developed using some form of version control system, such as Git. By default, a Git project stores all of its version control data in a folder called [[C0]]. Occasionally, websites expose this directory in the production environment. In this case, you might be able to access it by simply browsing to [[C1]].' => 'Hampir semua situs dikembangkan memakai sistem kontrol versi seperti Git yang menyimpan seluruh riwayatnya pada folder [[C0]]. Jika folder tersebut ikut terekspos di server produksi, isi riwayatnya dapat diakses lewat [[C1]].',
    "While it is often impractical to manually browse the raw file structure and contents, there are various methods for downloading the entire [[C0]] directory. You can then open it using your local installation of Git to gain access to the website's version control history. This may include logs containing committed changes and other interesting information." => 'Meskipun tidak praktis menelusuri isi direktori [[C0]] secara manual, seluruh repositori dapat diunduh lalu dibuka secara lokal memakai Git untuk memeriksa log komit dan perubahan lampau.',
    'This might not give you access to the full source code, but comparing the diff will allow you to read small snippets of code. As with any source code, you might also find sensitive data hard-coded within some of the changed lines.' => 'Dengan memeriksa diff komit, penyerang sering menemukan potongan kode penting hingga kata sandi atau kunci rahasia yang sempat terkomit sebelumnya.',
];
